APPLICABILITY

This CC-BY-4.0 license applies to all textual and academic content in this
repository, including but not limited to:

  - LaTeX source files (*.tex)
  - Markdown documentation (*.md)
  - Research reports and academic papers
  - Formal proofs (Lean 4, Coq, Z3 scripts)
  - Reference verification data and evidence tables
  - Configuration and manifest files that describe academic content

Code (scripts, CI pipelines, test suites, automation) remains under the MIT
License (see LICENSE-MIT).

When both licenses apply to a file (e.g., a script that generates academic
content), the more restrictive license (CC-BY-4.0) takes precedence for the
academic content, and MIT applies to the code structure.
